# Section 14
privacy-s14-h2 = 14. Google API Services User Data Policy Compliance
privacy-s14-p1-prefix = Our use and transfer of information received from Google APIs will adhere to the
privacy-s14-p1-link-text = Google API Services User Data Policy
privacy-s14-p1-suffix = , including the Limited Use requirements.
privacy-s14-li2 = <strong>No Sale of Data:</strong> We do not sell your Google user data.
privacy-s14-li3 = <strong>No Use for Advertising:</strong> We do not use or transfer your Google user data for serving advertisements, including personalized, re-targeted, or interest-based advertising.
privacy-s14-li4-title = <strong>Limited Transfer:</strong> We will not transfer your Google user data to others unless it is:
privacy-s14-li4-sub2 = To comply with applicable laws.
privacy-s14-li4-sub3 = As part of a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets of Jissicko Software (with prior notice to you).
privacy-s14-li4-sub4 = Necessary for security purposes (e.g., investigating abuse related to account access).
privacy-s14-li5-title = <strong>No Human Reading (unless exceptions apply):</strong> We do not allow humans to read your Google user data (email, name, profile picture) unless:
privacy-s14-li5-sub1 = We have your affirmative consent for specific data related to a support request or account issue you've raised.
privacy-s14-li5-sub2 = It is necessary for security purposes (e.g., investigating account abuse).
privacy-s14-li5-sub3 = To comply with applicable laws.
privacy-s14-li5-sub4 = The data is used for internal operations directly related to managing your account or providing support, and access is limited, logged, and directly relevant to the operation.
privacy-s14-li6 = <strong>Secure Data Handling:</strong> We maintain robust security practices as outlined in Section 7 to protect your Google user data.